  "atomicAlgebraDiagnostics": {},
  "summary": "整篇形式证明尚未通过 Lean Kernel；请查看原稿锚点、编译诊断和翻译缺口，不能据此判定原数学证明错误。",
  "sourceSteps": [
    {
      "id": "source-0",
      "index": 0,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 104,
      "end": 184,
      "sourceExcerpt": "由恒等式 t^6−1=(t−1)(t+1)(t²+t+1)(t²−t+1)，以及 p 为素数且 p|(n^6−1)，p 必整除这四个因子中的至少一个。逐一讨论。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_0",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-1",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 185,
      "end": 258,
      "sourceExcerpt": "情形一，p|(n²+n+1)。则模 p 有 n+1≡−n²，所以 (n+1)^6≡n^12≡(n^6)^2≡1。因此 p|((n+1)^6−1)。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_1",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-2",
      "index": 2,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 259,
      "end": 316,
      "sourceExcerpt": "情形二，p|(n+1)。则 n+2≡1 (mod p)，所以 (n+2)^6≡1，故 p|((n+2)^6−1)。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_2",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-3",
      "index": 3,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 317,
      "end": 381,
      "sourceExcerpt": "情形三，p|(n−1)。则 n≡1 (mod p)，故 n−2≡−1 (mod p)，从而 (n−2)^6≡1 (mod p)。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_3",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-4",
      "index": 4,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 381,
      "end": 415,
      "sourceExcerpt": "若 n≥4，则 n−2>1 且 n−2<n，这与 n 的最小性矛盾。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_4",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-5",
      "index": 5,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 415,
      "end": 456,
      "sourceExcerpt": "因此此情形只能有 n=2 或 n=3；但 n=2 时 p|1 不可能，故 n=3。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_5",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-6",
      "index": 6,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 456,
      "end": 502,
      "sourceExcerpt": "此时 p|(n−1)=2，故 p=2；而 (n+2)^6−1=5^6−1 为偶数，结论成立。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_6",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-7",
      "index": 7,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 503,
      "end": 561,
      "sourceExcerpt": "情形四，p|(n²−n+1)。则 n−1≡n² (mod p)，因此 (n−1)^6≡n^12≡1 (mod p)。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_7",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-8",
      "index": 8,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 561,
      "end": 590,
      "sourceExcerpt": "若 n≥3，则 1<n−1<n，违反最小性，所以 n=2。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_8",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-9",
      "index": 9,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 590,
      "end": 641,
      "sourceExcerpt": "此时 p|(2²−2+1)=3，即 p=3，且 (n+2)^6−1=4^6−1=4095 可被3整除。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_9",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-10",
      "index": 10,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 642,
      "end": 661,
      "sourceExcerpt": "以上四种情形穷尽所有可能，故断言成立。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_10",
      "dependsOn": []
    }
  ],
